worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_05.js"
  ceiling 1471
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1466 to 1471 for issue #1173 R3 (2026-10-07): the year-count reader no longer stops at the "year" of "compounded yearly", and the CSV-to-JSON request gets its reader, so probes p069 and p119 reach their handlers in both runtimes."
